sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    title YuPay — Payme (Paycom) Merchant API payment

    participant U as User (miniapp)
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant PAY as payments.service
    participant PG as PaymeGateway
    participant DB as Postgres
    participant PM as Payme (checkout.paycom.uz)
    participant PSVC as payme.service
    participant FUL as fulfillment.service

    Note over U,PM: pending_payment order, currency == UZS

    U->>API: POST /payments/intents {order_id, provider: payme}
    API->>PAY: create_intent(order_id, "payme")
    PAY->>DB: SELECT order FOR UPDATE (status == pending_payment)
    PAY->>PG: create_intent(db, order, return_url)
    PG->>PSVC: build_checkout_url(order_id, amount_tiyin, return_url)
    PSVC-->>PG: intent_url = checkout_url + "/" + base64(m=..,ac.order_id=..,a=..,c=..,l=..)
    PG-->>PAY: PaymentIntent(external_id="payme:<order_id>", intent_url, status=pending)
    PAY->>DB: INSERT payments(provider=payme, status=pending, external_id)
    PAY-->>U: 201 {intent_url}
    U->>PM: open intent_url, pay with card

    Note over PM,API: Payme is now the JSON-RPC CLIENT — it drives our<br/>/payments/payme/merchant endpoint (Basic auth Paycom:<key>)

    PM->>API: POST /payments/payme/merchant {method: CheckPerformTransaction, params: {amount, account}}
    API->>PSVC: check_perform_transaction(amount, account)
    PSVC->>DB: SELECT order (validate pending_payment + amount == total_charged*100)
    PSVC-->>API: {allow: true}
    API-->>PM: 200 {result: {allow: true}}

    PM->>API: POST /merchant {method: CreateTransaction, params: {id, time, amount, account}}
    API->>PSVC: create_transaction(payme_id, time, amount, account)
    PSVC->>DB: INSERT payme_transactions (state=1, UNIQUE payme_id)
    PSVC-->>API: {create_time, transaction, state: 1}
    API-->>PM: 200 {result: {...}}

    alt buyer completes payment
        PM->>API: POST /merchant {method: PerformTransaction, params: {id}}
        API->>PSVC: perform_transaction(payme_id)
        PSVC->>DB: UPDATE payme_transactions SET state=2, perform_time
        PSVC->>PAY: settle_provider_payment(payment, external_event_id=payme_id)
        PAY->>DB: payment.status=succeeded, order.status=paid (_mark_payment_succeeded)
        PAY->>FUL: start_for_order(order_id)
        PSVC-->>API: {transaction, perform_time, state: 2}
        API-->>PM: 200 {result: {...}}

        opt Payme cabinet-initiated refund
            PM->>API: POST /merchant {method: CancelTransaction, params: {id, reason}}
            API->>PSVC: cancel_transaction(payme_id, reason)
            PSVC->>DB: any FulfillmentTask succeeded, or order fulfilled/delivered?
            alt goods already delivered
                PSVC-->>API: PaymeError -31007 (cannot cancel delivered)
                API-->>PM: 200 {error: {code: -31007, ...}}
            else safe to reverse
                PSVC->>DB: UPDATE payme_transactions SET state=-2, cancel_time, reason
                PSVC->>PAY: reverse_provider_payment(payment, external_event_id=payme_id)
                PAY->>DB: _apply_refund_reversal: payment=refunded, order=refunded, ledger reversal
                PSVC-->>API: {transaction, cancel_time, state: -2}
                API-->>PM: 200 {result: {...}}
            end
        end
    else buyer abandons checkout, or Payme cancels before performing
        PM->>API: POST /merchant {method: CancelTransaction, params: {id, reason}}
        API->>PSVC: cancel_transaction(payme_id, reason)
        PSVC->>DB: UPDATE payme_transactions SET state=-1, cancel_time, reason
        PSVC->>PAY: cancel_pending_provider_payment(payment)
        PAY->>DB: payment.status=cancelled (order stays pending_payment)
        PSVC-->>API: {transaction, cancel_time, state: -1}
        API-->>PM: 200 {result: {...}}
    end

    Note over API,PM: Every response is HTTP 200 — success or error alike.<br/>A replay of any method on the same "id" echoes the stored result (idempotent).

    Note over PSVC,DB: apps/scheduler payme_timeout job: state-1 transactions<br/>older than 12h auto-cancel to -1, reason 4 (Payme never followed up)
